OL,3,GNEWSACouncil working to re-house care  
OL,4,Ahome residents                         
OL,6,FA council says it is working to find   
OL,7,Fnew accommodation for residents of a   
OL,8,Fcare home after an increase in         
OL,9,Fplacement costs.                       
OL,11,FEast Sussex County Council described it
OL,12,Fas "extremely disappointing" not to    
OL,13,Fhave been able to find a way forward to
OL,14,Fcontinue placements at Old Hastings    
OL,15,FHouse, which offers residential care   
OL,16,Fand secure dementia support.           
OL,18,F"We fully appreciate how unsettling the
OL,19,Fsituation is for residents and their   
OL,20,Ffamilies, particularly given the short 
OL,21,Fnotice and the time of year," a        
OL,22,Fspokesperson said.                     
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
