OL,3,GNEWSACouncil working to re-house care  
OL,4,Ahome residents                         
OL,6,FOld Hastings House said it had been    
OL,7,F"actively engaged" in discussions with 
OL,8,Fthe council for several months         
OL,9,Fregarding the affected residents and   
OL,10,Fthe funding challenges facing the home.
